CODE VALIDATION
========================================

File: DataAccess/ProductRepository.cs

Connection String Loading:
----------------------------------------
Constructor: public ProductRepository(IConfiguration configuration)

Connection String Selection Logic:
```csharp
var environment = _configuration["Environment"];
var connectionName = environment == "Production" ? "ProdConnection" : "DevConnection";
_connectionString = _configuration.GetConnectionString(connectionName);
```

Validation:
✓ Reads Environment from configuration
✓ Selects "ProdConnection" if Environment == "Production"
✓ Selects "DevConnection" otherwise
✓ Uses GetConnectionString() method correctly
✓ Stores connection string in _connectionString field
✓ Connection string properly passed to NpgsqlConnection constructor

Connection Instantiation:
----------------------------------------
Method: private async Task<NpgsqlConnection> GetConnectionAsync()

Connection Creation Logic:
```csharp
